<title>POLAND: ZYWIEC SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.02 MLN.</title>
<headline>ZYWIEC SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.02 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> SEPTEMBER	     1996	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.02 vs   2.71</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.52 vs   3.16</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.32 vs   3.20</p>
<p> Sales		   19.28 vs  15.04</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.83 vs   2.71</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	13.59 vs  36.77</p>
<p> Operating profit    17.79 vs  29.89</p>
<p> Sales		  197.97 vs 153.04</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish brewer is Zakoady Piwowarskie</p>
<p>Zywiec w Zywcu.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
